Hepatian is a metal, copper in colour and soft enough to forge without heating it. A blade made from it bends instead of cutting, so almost nobody uses it. The crossbow called the Aegisfur, kept in [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin|the lava ruin]] beneath [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]], is made of Hepatian.
